# Architecture

- Flutter + Riverpod + GoRouter
- Feature structure: `features/<name>/data|domain|presentation`
- Shared: `shared/models`, `shared/repositories`, `shared/mock_data`
- Mock-first, backend-ready: Repository interfaces, Mock implementations first
- No business logic in widgets; use Notifiers/Repositories
- Realtime-ready: Voting/Chat as Streams with proper dispose
- Local storage: SharedPreferences; tokens later via Flutter Secure Storage
